title: Linux: Reboot required
agents: linux
catalog: os/misc
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 Reports a required reboot: reboot-required flag (Debian/Ubuntu), dnf/yum
 needs-restarting, zypper needs-rebooting, a newer installed kernel than the
 running one, or missing modules of the running kernel. Optionally escalates
 after a configurable time. Services needing a restart are listed
 (needrestart, needs-restarting -s, zypper ps). Inside containers the service
 is not applicable and stays OK.

discovery:
 One service is created on each host that sends the linux_updates section.
